14	- **TDD, strictly.** Branch: `feat/fit-diary`. No AI attribution.
15	- **Local dates only.** Grid cells, "today", and the streak all use the user's local date (`lib/outfits/local-date.ts`). A UTC comparison highlights the wrong cell all evening for eastern users.
