11	## Global Constraints
12	
13	- **Depends on two plans**: `2026-07-24-item-data-completeness.md` (price, colours, texture) and `2026-07-24-outfit-detail-wear-logging.md` (wear data). Three of the four stat tiles are empty without them.
14	- **TDD, strictly.** Branch: `feat/item-detail-rebuild`. No AI attribution.
15	- **No AI calls on this screen.** Everything here is a query or deterministic scoring.
