5	**Goal:** Stop the season tag from being able to silently produce zero outfits — make it order and score candidates instead of eliminating them, exactly as outerwear and the Refine colour lean already do.
6	
7	**Architecture:** Season logic moves into one small module (`lib/generator/season.ts`). The hard filter in `isEligible` is deleted. In its place, season acts in two soft ways: `buildCandidates` orders each category in-season-first (so the 200-combo cap can't discard the good ones), and `scoreCombo` gains a weighted `seasonFit` term that ranks in-season combos above off-season ones. Measured weather (temperature, rain) keeps filtering hard in `weatherRules` — that is a real reading; a season tag is a coarse month-derived label.
